  "若要自己核验：顶点原子被 8 个晶胞共有、棱上被 4 个共有、面上被 2 个共有、": "To verify it yourself: a corner atom is shared by 8 unit cells, an edge atom by 4, a face atom by 2,",
  "体内完全属于本晶胞。": "and one inside the cell belongs entirely to that cell.",
  "两者的比值正是结构基元所含的原子数（见 C2-1）。": "The ratio of the two is exactly the number of atoms in the structural motif (see C2-1).",
  "**一个可靠的直觉**：晶胞原子数 ≥ 点阵点数，等号只在\"结构基元是单个原子\"时成立。": "**A reliable intuition**: atoms per unit cell ≥ lattice points per cell, with equality only when \"the structural motif is a single atom\".",
  "点阵点数": "lattice points per cell",
