  "以为 A1 与 A3 的空间利用率不同（两种最密堆积的理论值相同）": "Believing A1 and A3 have different packing fractions (the two close packings have the same theoretical value)",
  "把空间利用率与物质密度混为一谈（前者只与堆积方式有关，后者还取决于元素种类）": "Confusing the packing fraction with the density of the substance (the former depends only on the packing mode, the latter also on the element)",
  "以为 A2 的空间利用率高于 A1（体心堆积比最密堆积低）": "Believing A2 has a higher packing fraction than A1 (body-centred packing is lower than close packing)",
  "★ A1 与 A3 的层序：ABCABC 与 ABAB": "★ The layer sequences of A1 and A3: ABCABC and ABAB",
  "[教材] 晶体结构章 · 密置层的堆积": "[Textbook] Crystal structure chapter · Stacking of close-packed layers",
  "要理解层序，先看**一层密置球**：球排成六方紧密的平面，每个球周围有 6 个球，": "To understand the layer sequence, first look at **one close-packed layer**: the spheres form a hexagonal close plane, each sphere surrounded by 6 spheres,",
  "球之间留下两种朝向的三角形空隙。": "leaving triangular gaps of two orientations between the spheres.",
  "把第二层球放在第一层的**同一种**空隙上（记为 B 位置，第一层记为 A）。": "Place the second layer of spheres on the **same kind** of gap of the first layer (call it position B, and the first layer A).",
  "到第三层时出现了两种放法：": "By the third layer there are two possibilities:",
  "· 放在**第一层没有用过的那种**空隙上（C 位置）→ 层序 **ABCABC…** = A1": "· Place it on **the kind of gap the first layer did not use** (position C) → layer sequence **ABCABC…** = A1",
  "· 放回**第一层的位置**（A 位置）→ 层序 **ABAB…** = A3": "· Place it back **on the position of the first layer** (position A) → layer sequence **ABAB…** = A3",
  "**关键区别**：第三层与第一层**是否错开**。错开（落到 C）就是立方最密；": "**The key difference**: whether the third layer is **offset** from the first. Offset (landing on C) gives cubic close packing;",
  "对齐（回到 A）就是六方最密。": "aligned (returning to A) gives hexagonal close packing.",
  "**为什么名字是\"立方\"与\"六方\"**：ABCABC 的重复周期形成立方的对称性": "**Why the names are \"cubic\" and \"hexagonal\"**: the repeat period of ABCABC produces cubic symmetry",
  "（点阵型式 cF）；ABAB 的重复周期形成六方的对称性（点阵型式 hP）。": "(lattice type cF); the repeat period of ABAB produces hexagonal symmetry (lattice type hP).",
  "所以层序与点阵型式是**同一个事实的两种描述**。": "So the layer sequence and the lattice type are **two descriptions of the same fact**.",
  "本库里可以切换着看 Cu 型（fcc）与 Mg 型（hcp）两个晶体对照，": "In this library you can switch between the Cu type (fcc) and the Mg type (hcp) and compare them;",
  "两者的堆积密度看不出差别，但层序在侧视方向能看出来。": "their packing densities show no visible difference, but the layer sequence can be seen from the side.",
