  "[E-A2] 把两种层序与两个晶体名对错（Cu 型是 A1/ABC，Mg 型是 A3/AB）": "[E-A2] Mismatching the two layer sequences with the two crystal names (Cu type is A1/ABC, Mg type is A3/AB)",
  "以为 A1 与 A3 的差别在\"球的大小\"或\"密堆积的方向\"": "Believing A1 and A3 differ in \"the size of the spheres\" or \"the direction of close packing\"",
  "看不出层序差别时以为两个结构完全不同（它们同属最密堆积，只差层序）": "Concluding the two structures are completely different when the layer sequence is hard to see (both are close packings, differing only in layer sequence)",
  "A2 体心立方：为什么它不是最密堆积": "A2 body-centred cubic: why it is not a close packing",
  "[教材] 晶体结构章 · 体心立方堆积": "[Textbook] Crystal structure chapter · Body-centred cubic packing",
  "体心立方堆积里，**没有密置层**——这是它与 A1/A3 的根本差别。": "In body-centred cubic packing there **are no close-packed layers** — this is the fundamental difference from A1/A3.",
  "它的球沿**体对角线**方向相切：每个球在体对角线两端的最近邻共 8 个，": "Its spheres touch along the **body diagonal**: each sphere has 8 nearest neighbours at the ends of the body diagonals,",
  "所以配位数是 **8**，而不是最密堆积的 12。": "so the coordination number is **8**, not the 12 of a close packing.",
  "配位数从 12 降到 8，空间利用率也从约 74% 降到约 68%。": "As the coordination number drops from 12 to 8, the packing fraction drops from about 74% to about 68% as well.",
  "**这不是\"堆得不够用心\"**：体心立方是许多金属（α-Fe、W、Mo、碱金属）": "**This is not \"not packing carefully enough\"**: body-centred cubic is the structure in which many metals (α-Fe, W, Mo, the alkali metals)",
