  "**一个值得注意的点**：同一金属在不同温度下可能采用不同的堆积方式": "**A point worth noting**: the same metal may adopt different packing modes at different temperatures",
  "（如铁在高温下会从体心立方转变为面心立方），这类转变正是": "(for example iron changes from body-centred cubic to face-centred cubic at high temperature), and such transitions are exactly",
  "C8「结构—性能关联」的例证。": "an illustration of C8 \"structure–property correlation\".",
  "在三维视图里比较 Cu 型（A1）与 α-Fe 型（A2）时，可以打开**辅助体/辅助面**": "When comparing the Cu type (A1) with the α-Fe type (A2) in the 3D view, you can turn on the **auxiliary solid / auxiliary plane**",
  "图层，看相切方向是沿面对角线还是体对角线——这是最直接的区分方法。": "layer and see whether the touching direction runs along the face diagonal or the body diagonal — this is the most direct way to tell them apart.",
